        "w": 12,
        "h": 11
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Use these anywhere**: in any dashboard, *Add → Import from library* → pick a `TUI …` panel → *Unlink* (optional) → replace the sample queries with your own.\n\n- Templates don't care about field names: numeric fields become series, the first string field becomes categories; Grafana field config (unit, decimals, min/max, thresholds, display name) is honoured.\n- Convert an existing panel in place: change its visualization to *Business Text*, paste the one-line Content (e.g. `{{{tfTimeseries 90 14}}}`) and the helpers/styles from any TUI panel. Queries stay as they are.\n- Numbers in the braces are cell widths/heights — pick them for the panel size; auto-fit comes with the panel plugin.\n- Compare with stock panels: [before / after](/d/tuiflow-before-after/?theme=matrix)."
      }
    }
